WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:04,400
Finally here sir

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,320
Please let go first

3
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,120
If you want to see it, just do it openly

4
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,440
Anyone else would have been fascinated by this face.

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,980
She's fine

6
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:21,420
Will you resume drinking in a second, sir?

7
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:22,700
I don't drink

8
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,140
Besides

9
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,540
I can do anything

10
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,950
Anything can be done

11
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:36,340
I want you to stay with me tonight

12
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:37,850
I have to leave beforehand today

13
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:39,210
I'll see you next time

14
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:42,180
Don't need so much

15
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,460
This is what you deserve

16
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:46,100
You make me happy. How do you feel about it?

17
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:48,100
I think it’s not enough to buy me a good mood

18
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,820
The humiliation of receiving rewards in the past

19
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,470
Now I feel at ease with it
